        "pl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "18210b89-26bd-3711-bea8-50c416788e86",
                "word": "znienacka",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "pl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "48a1860e-2435-3d36-9a83-cfedf7876b32",
                        "entry_id": "18210b89-26bd-3711-bea8-50c416788e86",
                        "glosses": [
                            "nagle i niespodziewanie"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ddfc85d3-acef-4745-b880-a5eb6b8f6aa6",
                                "sense_id": "48a1860e-2435-3d36-9a83-cfedf7876b32",
                                "text": "Szedłem chodnikiem, gdy zza rogu znienacka wyjechał chłopiec na rowerze i prawie mnie potrącił."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8880f7a2-5a0b-44d8-a80c-24aad9c4966d",
                        "source_entry_id": "18210b89-26bd-3711-bea8-50c416788e86",
                        "source_sense_id": "48a1860e-2435-3d36-9a83-cfedf7876b32",
                        "target_lang_word": "out of the blue",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "out of the blue",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "62887912-de42-3ed8-8c9b-dacb18ee2a11",
                                        "entry_id": "272069a3-0263-38cb-b004-a2eb8212ea04",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unexpectedly; without warning or preparation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f29e1ca8-11ff-442c-8343-3d254ef11c27",
                                                "sense_id": "62887912-de42-3ed8-8c9b-dacb18ee2a11",
                                                "text": "After I hadn’t heard from her in six months, she called me out of the blue to meet for lunch."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bbed41a-a83a-4175-90cc-bb6d154ae9c0",
                                                "sense_id": "62887912-de42-3ed8-8c9b-dacb18ee2a11",
                                                "text": "I really can't understand how something like this could simply pop up out of the blue."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c844460f-97f9-4bc7-8eba-8a60ad36de7e",
                                                "sense_id": "62887912-de42-3ed8-8c9b-dacb18ee2a11",
                                                "text": "I deckhanded on a fish boat for four years and knew no fisherman likes to be called out of the blue and have his numbers demanded!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5252a699-d28c-4c29-9531-70dcb790c9b4",
                                                "sense_id": "62887912-de42-3ed8-8c9b-dacb18ee2a11",
                                                "text": "Just as it appeared Arsenal had taken the sting out of the tie, Johnson produced a moment of outrageous quality, thundering a bullet of a left foot shot out of the blue and into the top left-hand corner of Wojciech Szczesny's net with the Pole grasping at thin air."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "74f11729-3cc2-4d32-bc6b-6695df4f841e",
                        "source_entry_id": "18210b89-26bd-3711-bea8-50c416788e86",
                        "source_sense_id": "48a1860e-2435-3d36-9a83-cfedf7876b32",
                        "target_lang_word": "à l'improviste",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8c0c62e4-c357-4869-9039-3a93f1713caa",
                        "source_entry_id": "18210b89-26bd-3711-bea8-50c416788e86",
                        "source_sense_id": "48a1860e-2435-3d36-9a83-cfedf7876b32",
                        "target_lang_word": "tout à coup",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tout à coup",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "065ac006-91d9-3af2-aedc-f86cd0efafa8",
                                        "entry_id": "1fb29ead-7e5a-3746-97ac-5feb1362745a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Soudainement ; en un moment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "863485e7-402c-4a5f-968a-ed6d983c258c",
                                                "sense_id": "065ac006-91d9-3af2-aedc-f86cd0efafa8",
                                                "text": "En effet, un type en casquette traversa tout à coup la rue et vint prévenir qu’on pouvait y aller."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "763962d7-2758-4490-b873-0984b08c072f",
                                                "sense_id": "065ac006-91d9-3af2-aedc-f86cd0efafa8",
                                                "text": "J’ai rêvé d’un ironiste qui, un beau jour, tout à coup, perdait son ironie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3576827e-a103-4dcd-a824-784f5e748c58",
                                                "sense_id": "065ac006-91d9-3af2-aedc-f86cd0efafa8",
                                                "text": "Les terribles prêcheurs des Seize, les moines qui portaient le mousquet aux processions de la Ligue, s’humanisent tout à coup ; les voilà devenus bénins. C'est qu’il faut bien essayer d’endormir ceux qu’on n’a pas pu tuer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "befb721c-7770-44b9-8b7e-ade5645382cc",
                                                "sense_id": "065ac006-91d9-3af2-aedc-f86cd0efafa8",
                                                "text": "Tout à coup, dominant les mornes intonations du célébrant, s’éleva la voix de Villegagnon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3cd06537-e025-4774-b513-a885507317e1",
                                                "sense_id": "065ac006-91d9-3af2-aedc-f86cd0efafa8",
                                                "text": "Et une vérité beaucoup plus cruelle le frappa tout à coup. Le géant avait épargné Ouma Nandi jusqu’à son entrée en scène calamiteuse. Qu’en aurait-il été s’il n’avait pas tiré en l’air ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ce87315a-41e3-432e-be2b-c2825eacf265",
                        "source_entry_id": "18210b89-26bd-3711-bea8-50c416788e86",
